		<section name="node">
			<attribute key="id" type="int">36</attribute>
			<attribute key="label" type="String">Following are some hints for coming up with new test cases.

1. Normal test cases
1.1. Starting is a negative integer and ending is a positive integer
1.2. Starting is a positive integer and ending is a positive integer

2. Boundary test cases
2.1. Starting is 0 and ending is a positive integer
2.2. Starting is a negative integer and ending is 0
2.3. Starting is 0 and ending is 0
2.4. Starting is a negative integer and ending is a negative integer
2.5. Starting and ending values are same (positive)
2.6. Starting and ending values are same (negative)

Based on these hints, you can come up with at least 8 new test cases.
Write them on a paper.</attribute>
